<title>USA: Aames says knows no reason for stock rise.</title>
<headline>Aames says knows no reason for stock rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW  YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aames Financial Corp said in response to a query that it was not aware of any specific reason why its stock was up seven percent Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There is not anything specific to our knowledge that is affecting it,&quot; a spokeswoman said. But she also noted executives of the mortgage brokerage were conducting a &quot;road show&quot; explaining a recent secondary offering of equity to investors.</p>
<p>Aames was up 3-5/8 to 56-1/2 in afternoon trade and earlier in the session reached a new high of 58.</p>
